    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="meta-info">
        <strong>App Name:</strong> WOW Helper<br>
        <strong>Developer:</strong> Pranab Debnath (GNB Publishing)<br>
        <strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 15, 2026
    </div>

    <p>Welcome to <strong>WOW Helper</strong>. Your privacy is critically important to us. This Privacy Policy outlines the types of information processed by the app, how it is used, and how your data remains protected when using our services.</p>

    <h2>1. Information Collection &amp; Local Processing</h2>
    <p><strong>WOW Helper</strong> is designed with privacy-first principles. Most features operate entirely offline and locally on your device:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Direct WhatsApp Chat:</strong> Phone numbers and text messages entered in the Direct Chat feature are used solely to construct standard WhatsApp web links (<code>api.whatsapp.com</code>). <strong>No phone numbers or chat messages are stored, tracked, or sent to any external server.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Hardware &amp; Sensor Tests:</strong> Tools such as Mic Test, Speaker Test, Camera Test, Sensors, and Battery Info read hardware status locally. No media recordings or telemetry logs leave your device.</li>
        <li><strong>File &amp; Document Utilities:</strong> PDF operations (Merge, Split, Compress) and Image utilities (Compress, Resize, Crop, Converter) process files <strong>strictly inside your device's memory</strong>. Your personal files are never uploaded to any remote server.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. In-App Purchases &amp; Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>If you purchase a Pro subscription or lifetime access within the app, financial transactions are handled securely by <strong>Google Play Billing</strong>. We do not collect, store, or have access to your credit card details or banking information. We only receive purchase confirmation tokens from Google Play to unlock Pro features.</p>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>The app relies on trusted third-party services that govern data according to their respective privacy policies:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Play Billing / Google Play Services:</strong> Manages in-app subscriptions and app functionality. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp (Meta Platforms, Inc.):</strong> Handles intent redirects when using the Direct Chat tool. <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp Privacy Policy</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. App Permissions</h2>
    <p>To provide specific utility features, the app may request access to runtime permissions. You can grant or revoke these anytime via your Android System Settings:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Camera:</strong> Required for the Camera Test and document scanner features.</li>
        <li><strong>Microphone:</strong> Required for testing hardware microphone input.</li>
        <li><strong>Storage / Media:</strong> Required to select, edit, compress, or convert local images and PDF documents.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data Security &amp; Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Because we do not transmit or store your personal data on external servers, your data remains secure on your physical device. The app does not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under the age of 13.</p>

